  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Find the exact value of $4\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({15}^{\u2218}).$",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x=\\operatorname{sin}\u20612x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={7.5}^{\u2218}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218}) & =\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(2\\cdot {7.5}^{\u2218})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218}) & =\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({15}^{\u2218}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({15}^{\u2218}) & =2\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({15}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({15}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({15}^{\u2218})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the double-angle formula once more with $x={15}^{\u2218},$ we can further simplify the above expression: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061{15}^{\u2218}\\operatorname{cos}\u2061{15}^{\u2218}=\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(2\\cdot {15}^{\u2218})=\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({30}^{\u2218})\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({7.5}^{\u2218})\\operatorname{cos}\u2061({15}^{\u2218}) & =\\operatorname{sin}\u2061({30}^{\u2218})=\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
